<title>UK: UK's Harrisons appoints new exec. director.</title>
<headline>UK's Harrisons appoints new exec. director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals company Harrisons &amp; Crosfield Plc said on Wednesday that it had appointed Mike Parker as its executive director.</p>
<p>The appointment takes effect from February 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Parker joins Harrisons from Zeneca where he is working as business director of Zeneca Specialities.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171-542 7717</p>
</text>
